<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>You shall know the truth,</l><l>And the truth shall set you free.</l><l>You have received Him,</l><l>Been delivered from sin!</l><l>The freedom is in you—</l><l>Christ the Jubilee.</l><l>Never be entangled</l><l>With a yoke of slavery!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
